      {
        "document": "document_1",
        "sha256": "d57c049c89aec4615f5b939c5a96ee9bd194142d17045bc4036615cfbdf0f1c7",
        "start_line": 42,
        "end_line": 42,
        "quote": "13. If the customer gives day and month the other way round, `verify_identity` returns `hint: \"day_month_swapped\"`. Ask them to say the month as a word. That retry does not count as a wrong answer."
      }
